      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: None configured",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo and its remote(s) only (no additional orgs configured) — as scoped by the Trusted repo and Repository visibility entries above",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment (hyphen/underscore/dot-delimited — e.g. matches `prod-db`, not `producer`)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development",
      "**Trusted repo**: The git repository the agent started in ({{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/{{ if eq .chezmoi.os "windows" }}Nextcloud2{{ else }}Nextcloud{{ end }}/Apps/Obsidian) — no remotes are configured, so treat it as local-only; visibility unknown/unqueryable, assume private",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured"
{{ else }}
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: PUBLIC — papatenko/cougarcs-tui (github.com:papatenko/cougarcs-tui.git) — any push here is publishing",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: Default branch is main; no protected branches or rulesets listed (public repo — treat main as push-sensitive regardless)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (papatenko/cougarcs-tui, github.com:papatenko/cougarcs-tui.git) and its remote only — no additional orgs configured",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment (hyphen/underscore/dot-delimited)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (TUI/design tooling project — cougarcs-tui)",
      "**Trusted repo**: {{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/Nextcloud/Projects/code/school/cougarcs-tui and its remote github.com:papatenko/cougarcs-tui.git — PUBLIC repo, so only this repo's own work belongs here; content ported or first read from outside this session's repo is not its own work",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "routine under {{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/Nextcloud/Projects/code/school/cougarcs-tui/ prefix: TypeScript/Bun build, test, capture, and Python font/raster tooling (perl, fontforge, npx, pwd) as seen in this project's transcripts"
{{ end }}
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "bash -c 'p=$(ls -d \"$HOME\"/.claude/plugins/cache/openviking/openviking-memory/*/scripts/statusline.mjs 2>/dev/null | sort -V | tail -1); [ -n \"$p\" ] && exec node \"$p\"; exit 0'",
    "padding": 0
  },
  "voiceEnabled": true,
  "voice": {
    "enabled": true,
    "mode": "hold"
  }
}
